{
  "out": "/tmp/photonz-playtest/one-outline-two-kinds",
  "seed": "Picking a rectangle and a screenshot together used to list Outline twice, one for the line the shape draws itself and one for the ring the picture wears. This walk picks both, reads the Appearance list, and pushes the one switch, the one colour and the one Width to see all of them land on both layers.",
  "steps": [
